# Docket is local run state end to end — case ledgers, generated workflow
# scripts, and the dossier the loop accumulates as it works. The dossier
# used to be tracked on the theory that it was project config; it is not.
# It is one machine's record of how its own runs went, it means nothing to
# anyone else reading this repository, and it grows without review.
.docket/

# Skiff run traces and calibration logs are local run history.
.skiff/

